	},
	x: -2.0d,
	y: 5.5d,
	text: [
		"Everything in this dimension decays over time, including your tools and weapons.",
		"",
		"The more corrosion a tool/weapon has, the less effective/strong it is.",
		"",
		"There are however ways to clean and preserve them.",
		"",
		"One of those ways is the purifier. Simply fill it with swamp water and sulfur, and place your corroded tool into the top slot. After a few seconds it will be clean again.",
		"",
		"To check how corroded your tool is, look at its tooltip.",
		"It will tell your if it's \"Good as new!\", \"Slightly corroded\", and so on.",
		"",
		"If you want to see the exact numbers, turn on advanced tooltips (F3 + H)"
	],
